# Dataset Options

## CLadder
https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.04350
    - https://huggingface.co/datasets/causal-nlp/CLadder
    - https://github.com/causalNLP/cladder
    - Yes, its workable, because it provides `graph_id`s, we can cross reference a structure and then replace the node names in our version.



## METER: Evaluating Multi-Level Contextual Causal Reasoning in LLMs
    - https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.11502v2
    - https://github.com/SCUNLP/METER
    - Seems most promising (except no graphs)

## CausalDS (ACL 2026)
https://arxiv.org/html/2607.08093
    - https://github.com/andleb/causalds/tree/main/data
    - https://huggingface.co/datasets/andleb/causalds


NOT RECOMMENDED:

## CausalGraph2LLM
https://aclanthology.org/2025.findings-naacl.110/
    - https://github.com/ivaxi0s/CausalGraph2LLM/tree/main
- Semantic Nodes, Directed Graphs, Some Intervention Reasoning (in contextual subset)
